    "coverageNote": "The UK has ZERO codes in this dataset from 2017 onward (checked through 2025) — a complete, seemingly permanent absence, unlike the homicide layer's partial NUTS-vintage mismatch. Albania has ZERO codes at all, for the same structural reason as every other OECD layer here — Albania is not an OECD member."
